{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21181","headline":"别李三 · 元稹","name":"别李三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阶蓂附瑶砌，藂兰偶芳藿。\n高位良有依，幽姿亦相托。\n鲍叔知我贫，烹葵不爲薄。\n半面契始终，千金比然诺。\n人生系时命，安得无苦乐。\n但感游子颜，又值余英落。\n苍苍秦树云，去去缑山鹤。\n日暮分手归，杨花满城郭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}